  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the UN Human Rights Monitoring Mission in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve respect for human rights in conflict-affected areas by supporting the UN Human Rights Monitoring Mission. The project explicitly targets women&#x2019;s rights NGOs (among others). The Mission advises UN agencies on gender equality and mainstreaming and reports on gender-related HR violations. Their report on conflict-related sexual violence contained recommendations that the Mission actively follows up in cooperation with partners, including legal assistance to the victims.</narrative>
  </description>
